proche ancrée dans <span style="color:#A0626A;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">l<span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">'ici et maintenant</span>,</span> qui prend en compte le corps, les émotions et la relation.<br class="wixui-rich-text__text"> La thérapie permet d'explorer ce que vous vivez en profondeur, de mieux se comprendre, de traverser une difficulté.</h6></div><div id="comp-ms4nidu0" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-ms4nidu0 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h6 class="font_6 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.9em; margin-left:40px; text-align:center; font-size:20px;"><span style="color:#A80D42;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Bienveillance • Non jugement • Confidentialité</span></span></h6></div><div id="comp-ms4nkb2r" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-ms4nkb2r wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h6 class="font_6 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.9em; margin-left:40px; text-align:center; font-size:20px;">Je vous reçois à Tours, à Paris, ou en visio.</h6></div><div id="comp-ms4nuvh7" class="comp-ms4nuvh7"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.psychologue.net/cabinets/elisa-gatay-hauet" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="StylableButton2545352419__root StylableButton2545352419__forcedColorsBackground style-mvxu9uta__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="Prendre rdv"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">Prendre rdv</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span> <svg viewbox="0 0 200 200" height="200" width="200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <g> <path d="M100 20c-44.183 0-80 35.817-80 80s35.817 80 80 80 80-35.817 80-80-35.817-80-80-80zm35.533 91.251l-30.37 28.03a7.27 7.27 0 0 1