x; line-height:normal;"><span style="font-size:42px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Partenariat avec <span style="color:#7C56E3;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Liberlo</span></span></span></h2></div><div id="comp-mmap4cnw" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mmap4cnw wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://mon.apicil.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Cette mutuelle, selon le contrat souscrit, rembourse des séances de Gestalt thérapie. Renseignez-vous ;)</a></span></p></div><div id="comp-mmaoatv73" class="comp-mmaoatv73 nJiBti wixui-horizontal-line"></div><div id="comp-mmaoatv78" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mmaoatv78 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; line-height:1.8em;"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Je suis référencée par <span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://liberlo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Liberlo </a></span></span></span><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://liberlo.com/#" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">(</a></span><a href="https://liberlo.com/#" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Groupe Apicil, soit le 3e groupe de protection sociale en France).</a></p></div><div id="comp-mmanvxki" class="O5G82F comp-mmanvxki e24tXb"><div><wix-iframe><div class="vWU4ML"><iframe class="xxJnkq" title="Embedded Content" name="htmlComp-iframe" width="100%" height="100%" allow="fullscreen" src="/assets/original/c5b4c4db13349926ebad.html" loading="lazy"></iframe></div></wix-iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section id="comp-mi8lkk75" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mi8lkk75 wixui-section"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mi8lkk75" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mi8lkk75" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mi8lkk75" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mi8lkk75" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mi8lkk75inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mi8lkk75inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mi8lkk7g1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mi8lkk7g1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px; line-height:normal;"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Si la thérapie m'était contée</span></span></h2></div><div id="comp-mi8lkk7n" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mi8lkk7n wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px;">Voici une petite histoire qui illustre simplement le chemin de ce parcours (2 minutes de lecture). N'hésitez pas à me dire par mail si vous l'avez autant appréciée que moi. (auteur inconnu).</p></div><div id="comp-mi8lkk7o" class="comp-mi8lkk7o"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="/assets/original/32a7933384f94f638d5b.pdf" target="_blank" class="StylableButton2545352419__root StylableButton2545352419__forcedColorsBackground style-mvxuagqy__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="Je découvre"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">Je découvre</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg viewbox="0 0 200 200" height="200" width="200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <g> <path d="M172.5 142a7.485 7.485 0 0 1-5.185-2.073L100 75.808l-67.315 64.12c-2.998 2.846-7.74 2.744-10.606-.234a7.454 7.454 0 0 1 .235-10.565l72.5-69.057a7.524 7.524 0 0 1 10.371 0l72.5 69.057a7.455 7.455 0 0 1 .235 10.565A7.503 7.503 0 0 1 172.5 142z"></path> </g> </svg> </span></span></span></a></div><div id="comp-mi8lxoce" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mi8lxoce wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; line-height:1.8em;"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">La Gestalt aide à clarifier votre vécu, mettre de la conscience, et vous amène à une réelle transformation. Oui, le chemin que vous foulerez à votre arrivée sera réellement différent, pour du mieux, pour votre bien-être, votre épanouissement.</span></p></div></div></div></section><section id="comp-m4scrreh" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-m4scrreh wixui-section"><div id="bgLayers_comp-m4scrreh" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-m4scrreh" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-m4scrreh" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-m4scrreh" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-m4scrrehinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-m4scrrehinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mfw7s0mq" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mfw7s0mq wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:64px;">Blog</h2></div><div id="comp-mfqp3gs7" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mfqp3gs7 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_4 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px; line-height:normal;"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text